    "text": "kmaland.com\nwebsite\nShenandoah\nShenandoah comes up just short in postseason loss\nBy Ryan Matheny,\n11 hours ago(Onawa) – Shenandoah’s postseason upset bid at West Monona came up just short Wednesday night. The Fillies (10-18) stood toe-to-toe with Class 2A No. 15 West Monona (27-6), falling 6-4 in a regional quarterfinal on the road. “I’m so proud of the girls,” said head coach Cayley McCoy....",
